  "_note": "Litia's own section of the term bank. Covers Goals 1-4 of the UN's 17 Sustainable Development Goals - explicitly a work in progress, not a finished section. Tongan definitions are mostly blank throughout (only a handful of Goal 4 entries have one) - the Tongan TERM is present for almost every entry, but the Tongan DEFINITION is the gap here, the reverse of the pattern in Computer Terms. 'Education equality' is included exactly as it appears in the source - missing its own Tongan term and English definition, with what looks like a near-duplicate of 'Education equity' in its Tongan definition field. Worth Litia's eye directly.",
